{"sourceUrl":"https://sxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/85/c8793a242565/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.131639+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sxy.cpu.edu.cn/b3/85/c8793a242565/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span>中国药科大学国际医药商学院立足医药卫生行业，充分发挥学校深厚的药学办学优势，坚持药学与经管法学科交叉融合、特色发展，现有</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>个博士学位授权点、</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士学位授权点，本科、硕士、博士、博士后培养层次贯通，学术学位、专业学位培养类型齐全，拥有业界知名、学术水平高的导师队伍和科研团队。学院面向国家卫生和健康产业发展需要，为社会输送了一大批应用型、复合型、国际化的高素质药学特色人才，成为培养和造就高级医药经营管理人才的摇篮。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院欢迎广大优秀学子报考和攻读研究生，聚天下英才而育之。根据学校研究生院《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span><span><span>号）的有关规定和工作要求，现开展我院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名工作，有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、招生专业</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年硕士招生专业目录中除公共管理硕士（</span></span></span></span><span><span>MPA</span></span><span><span><span><span>）以外的所有专业均可接收硕士推免生。</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>学位类型</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1007Z2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>社会与管理药学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1007Z8</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药物经济学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>120400</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>公共管理学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span><span><span>07</span></span><span><span><span><span>管理药学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span><span><span>08</span></span><span><span><span><span>生物经济学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span><span><span>09</span></span><span><span><span><span>医药投资管理</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>直博生招生专业</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>学位类型</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1007Z2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>社会与管理药学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1007Z8</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药物经济学</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、报名条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>（一）推免生预选拔报名考生应符合以下基本条件：</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、全国高校</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类、经济学类、统计学类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>说明：未参加我校“</span></span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目但符合上述条件的本校学生，可以报名参加常规学制年限的推免生考核。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>（二）学术学位直博推免生报考基本条件：</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请学术学位直博生者，除满足上述报名条件（一）中的基本条件外，还应有较突出的专业素质，具有相应专业博士生培养潜质，学习成绩优异，并符合以下条件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、条件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>中的一条且同时满足条件</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、国家级一流本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span>10%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span><span><span>10%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；其他本科专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span><span><span>8%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、国家理科基础科学研究和教学人才培养基地班（理科基地班）、国家生命科学与技术人才培养基地班（生科基地班）、国家基础学科拔尖学生培养计划（拔尖计划）专业考生的本科推荐环节成绩排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span><span>（含</span></span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、获得外语等级证书或成绩证明</span></span></span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩有效期在</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>年之内</span></span></span></span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>六级（</span></span></span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span><span><span>450</span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>或托福（</span></span></span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span><span><span>分；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>或雅思（</span></span></span></span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩≥</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>或以第一作者（排位第一）在</span></span></span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span><span><span>期刊（不含扩展版）上发表过一篇专业学术研究论文。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>按照中国药科大学国家基础药学拔尖培养计划</span></span></span></span><span><span>2.0</span></span><span><span><span><span>基地班的相关文件规定，该专业直博推免生推荐资格由孟目的学院及学校相关部门考核认定，暂不通过推免生预报名系统报考。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、报名方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请人在规定时间段内，登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span><span><span>）自行注册系统账户，报名项目选择“推免生预报名”，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>-8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日系统开放报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前，学院对申请人资格进行审核，对入选者在系统中发放通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知的学生需于规定时间内在报名系统中回复确认是否参加，逾时未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四、报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身份证及在读学生证（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、就读国家级一流本科专业、理科基地班、生科基地班、拔尖计划的专业证明（符合条件者必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、外语水平证明，如</span></span></span></span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>、获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>、个人简历：限</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>页，应包含科研经历及获奖情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>、专家推荐书（暂不必填）：申请直博生者提供至少</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>份《专家推荐书》（可在预报名系统中生成下载模板），由所报考学科专业领域内的正高级教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）撰写的书面推荐意见（硕士推免生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>硕士推免报考材料由学院进行资格审核，直博生报考材料由研究生院统一进行资格审查。申请人必须保证各类报考材料的真实和准确，若发现材料有虚假，一经查实即取消申请人的报名资格及相应权利。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、考核安排</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、本次推免预接收考核采用线下形式进行。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>- 8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span><span><span>日开展学院宣讲和硕士推免选拔考核，具体时间地点另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>参加考核面试的学生提前准备</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>份个人简历</strong></span></span><span><span>，面试前提供给学科组专家。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>特别说明：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、复试合格且获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格者，须登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“全国推免服务系统”）填报志愿并按要求确认拟录取。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、入选我校“</span></span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目且考核合格的学生，需报名参加我院的推免生预选拔及复试考核，复试合格且在全国推免服务系统中实际拟录取的考生方可进入我院“</span></span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通培养体系。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名我院限填报</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、直博生申请人仅限填报</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>个直博生志愿，并应同时填报硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、食宿交通及相关保障</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>参加活动的学生来校参加考核期间的交通及食宿费用自理，学校统一为参加考核学生购买来校活动期间的交通意外保险。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>七、其它</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>国际医药商学院研究生招生委员会负责本次活动的组织领导工作，制定活动方案并组织实施。联系人：刘老师，联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>025-86185036</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>                         <span><span><span>中国药科大学国际医药商学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>                                 2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"4f04394beff5db11073aa5618ce086c78796e3f880db709df52409c90aaa8a14","textLength":2551,"sourceSha256":"7c417cd37072f2e31763c6611d69e74117eff2c1726d003e655396d7eaf9dc4c","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-108703bf561c44076bab","title":"2026年中国药科大学国际医药商学院2027年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.131639+00:00"}
